  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0114_27979200405d.png\" /><br />Equation tangent at <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />x-intercept of this tangent is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>.<br />Hence, area of <math><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8901;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
